:\n    journal = _FakeJournal()\n    entry_posting = _make_posting(journal, object(), Direction.CREDIT)\n\n    entry = LedgerEntry(ledger=None, posting=entry_posting, balance=Decimal(\"0\"))\n\n    assert entry.cntraccts == []\n    assert journal.postings == []\n```",
